      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00445",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "——只要想到从今天开始，我和姐姐就再也不能生活在一起了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Just thinking that from today on, my sister and I can no longer live together,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00445",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "写下这封信的时候，我便泪流不止。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "as I write this letter, my tears will not stop flowing.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00445",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "姐姐，恳请你，恳请你原谅我，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Sister, please, please forgive me,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00445",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "姐姐为我做了如此大的牺牲，照子难以言表。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I, Teruko, cannot put into words the great sacrifice you made for me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
